msgid "KeePass 2 XML is unencrypted plaintext containing directly readable passwords. Only open it from a trusted encrypted drive, and securely delete it after importing. BearWarden imports personal entries only and flattens nested groups into folder paths. Attachment binaries, history revisions, and advanced metadata are not imported, and recycle-bin and template groups are skipped. Modern KeePass TimeOtp fields are converted into a code-generating format. If the secret, encoding, or parameters conflict or cannot be converted, the entire import stops instead of silently skipping the authenticator."
msgstr "KeePass 2 XML is unencrypted plaintext containing directly readable passwords. Only open it from a trusted encrypted drive, and securely delete it after importing. BearWarden imports personal entries only and flattens nested groups into folder paths. Attachment binaries, history revisions, and advanced metadata are not imported, and recycle-bin and template groups are skipped. Modern KeePass TimeOtp fields are converted into a code-generating format. If the secret, encoding, or parameters conflict or cannot be converted, the entire import stops instead of silently skipping the authenticator."

